sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Host app (RN or web)
    participant BE as Your backend (mutation or /webform/instance)
    participant PROV as ESignProvider
    participant DS as DocuSign Web Forms API
    participant WV as WebView / iframe

    App->>BE: mint with the session token - prefill computed server-side, locked fields as Text strings
    BE->>PROV: createWebFormInstance(userId, prefill, returnUrl)
    alt mock provider
        PROV-->>BE: local mock web-form URL
    else DocuSign provider
        PROV->>DS: createInstance(clientUserId, formValues, returnUrl)
        DS-->>PROV: formUrl + instanceToken (~5 min TTL)
        PROV-->>BE: formUrl#instanceToken=...
    end
    BE-->>App: { url }
    App->>WV: embed url - locked terms shown read-only, the signer submits and signs the envelope
    alt plain WebView / iframe (RN and web)
        DS->>WV: redirect to returnUrl?event=...
        WV->>BE: GET /signing/return (the bridge page)
        WV-->>App: postMessage { event } from the bridge
    else DocuSign.js (web only)
        WV-->>App: sessionEnd event (signingResult / formConfirmation / sessionTimeout)
    end
    Note over App: interpretDocuSignEvent normalizes to complete / cancel / sessionExpired
